  "description": "A close-fitted desert hood and catchpocket face-seal — the full headseal. Ordinary quality recovers about 30% of water loss by itself, better than a loose stillsuit headwrap. It joins a stillsuit at the collar, recovers moisture from breath, and keeps sand from the eyes, nose, and mouth. Quality and remaining condition scale only this piece. This is desert survival kit, not Imperial war plate.",
